  "separator": "VS",
  "notes": [
    "Field location is card context and is not one of the numbered offensive-call slots.",
    "Backfield is an optional offensive slot immediately after personnel and before formation.",
    "Optional slots may be omitted without invalidating the call.",
    "No missing football object may be inferred or invented.",
    "Present slots must appear in the approved numbered order; omitted optional slots do not change the order of remaining slots.",
    "Formation cards use only personnel, backfield, formation, variation, motion, and shift; personnel and formation are required.",
    "Scout cards do not require offensive play; play cards do require offensive play.",
    "When no backfield is called, GUN is the coach-approved default backfield."
